# Terravado internal portal — environment
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. WITHOUT these set, the app runs in local-first
# dev mode (in-memory data, auth bypassed) so you can work without Supabase.

# Supabase (create a project at supabase.com — a separate free account for
# Terravado keeps it apart from TGS). Found in Project Settings → API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Google OAuth is configured inside Supabase (Authentication → Providers →
# Google), not here. See README for the redirect URL to register with Google.
